    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mason Estates are delighted to present for sale this 2/3 bedroom family home. A particular feature of this property is the spacious two storey extension to the rear giving this home generous sized living and bedroom accommodation. It also benefits from a large paved low maintenance rear garden with block built shed which could be converted to home office. To the front of the property there is a parking bay with ample parking spaces. \n\nIn brief, the accommodation comprises an entrance hall leading to parlour room/3rd bedroom on the right, straight ahead there is a spacious sitting room with double doors to kitchen/dining room. On the first floor there is an extended spacious landing with floor to ceiling storage units, double bedroom to the front, double bedroom to the rear and a third room which is currently in use as a bedroom, a spacious modern bathroom completes the accommodation. \n\nExcellently located at the Sundrive Road end of Ferns Road, within easy reach of Sundrive Shopping Centre and several other shopping outlets. Excellent public transport allowing for quick and easy access to the City Centre. Good choice of schools and recreational amenities. \n\nENTRANCE HALL: 1.75m x 2.76m\nWith laminate floor and down lighters.\n\nPARLOUR/3RD BEDROOM: 2.98m x 2.76m\nBright room located to the front of house, laminate floor.\n\nLIVING ROOM: 4.84m x 3.36m\nSpacious living room with feature fireplace, laminate floor, double doors to kitchen/dining.\n\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM: 3.88m x 4.29m\nSpacious bright room with large window and French doors to rear garden. Kitchen has ample floor and wall units, oven/hob, fridge/freezer, plumbed for washing machine Tiled floor and splash-back.\n\nFIRST FLOOR:\n\nEXTENDED LANDING WITH FEATURE ARCHES:\nWith built-in floor to ceiling storage units. Access point to attic.\n\nBEDROOM 1: 4.84m x 3.28 (max measurement)\nSpacious double bedroom with hot-press, located at the front of house.\n\nBEDROOM 2: 3.15m x 2.88m (max measurement)\nDouble bedroom located to the rear.\n\nROOM 3/STUDY: 3.18m x 2.85m\nLocated off the landing in the centre of house, with velux window, currently in use as double bedroom\n\nBATHROOM: 1.80m x 2.78m\nModern fully tiled shower room with natural light, incorporating bath/shower attachment, separate shower cubicle with electric shower, w.c., wash-hand-basin set in vanity unit, wall mounted mirror, heated towel rail. \n\nGARDENS:\n\nWalled front garden\nLarge paved rear garden with raised beds, trees and shrubbery.\nBlock built shed, re-roofed c. 5 years ago, potential for home office/gym etc.,\n\nGENERAL POINTS: SERVICES: UTILITIES\n\nBER C and the number is 119879831\nGas fired central heating\nDouble glazed windows\n"
      },
      {
